From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:32:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/imagination: apple: Let every geometry job take its VM's
 scene first

A client's first render on the iPad 5 fails without a log line when
another client rendered last. Its geometry job returns -EBUSY, then
its fragment job is refused with "fragment job without a geometry job".

The call that takes a VM's PM sets is inside the dependency choice for
consecutive jobs of the same VM. A new VM can therefore reach submission
without a PM set when the previous fragment belonged to another VM.

Call vm_scenes for every geometry job before selecting its dependency.
Keep the existing prev_frag/last_frag choice and locking context.

Affects the Apple A9 (S8003). The A10 has no vm_scenes callback and is
unchanged.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_apple.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_apple.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_apple.c
index b0505a2..5a43e3f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_apple.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_apple.c
@@ -1229,14 +1229,18 @@ int pvr_apple_job_add_deps(struct pvr_job *job)
 {
 	struct pvr_apple *apple = to_apple(job->pvr_dev);
 	struct dma_fence *last;
+	unsigned int scenes = 1;
 
 	if (job->type != DRM_PVR_JOB_TYPE_GEOMETRY && job->type != DRM_PVR_JOB_TYPE_FRAGMENT)
 		return 0;
 	spin_lock_irq(&apple->fence_lock);
+	/* Take this VM's first scene even when another VM rendered last. */
+	if (job->type == DRM_PVR_JOB_TYPE_GEOMETRY && apple->chip->vm_scenes)
+		scenes = apple->chip->vm_scenes(apple, job->ctx->vm_ctx);
 	if (job->type == DRM_PVR_JOB_TYPE_FRAGMENT)
 		last = apple->last_geom;
 	else if (apple->chip->scenes > 1 && apple->last_frag_vm == job->ctx->vm_ctx &&
-		 apple->chip->vm_scenes(apple, job->ctx->vm_ctx) > 1)
+		 scenes > 1)
 		last = apple->prev_frag;
 	else
 		last = apple->last_frag;

